"Project Northwind" (the "Mod") is an unofficial modification for Hearts of
Iron IV. This license covers all original content created by the Project
Northwind Team and its contributors, including code, scripts, lore,
documentation, localisation, and graphical assets ("Original Content").

This license does NOT cover Third-Party Content, as defined in Section 4.


1. WHAT YOU MAY DO

   The following permissions apply to Original Content only.

   a. Download, install, and play the Mod for personal, non-commercial use.
   b. Modify the Mod for your own private use.
   c. Create submods, compatibility patches, and translations, provided that:
      - they require the original Mod as a dependency, rather than
        including or reuploading its files;
      - they credit Project Northwind and link to its official page or
        repository;
      - they are distributed free of charge.
   d. Share links to the official Mod page or this repository.
   e. Create videos, streams, screenshots, and written content featuring
      the Mod, including monetised content on platforms such as YouTube
      or Twitch.


2. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

   a. Reupload the Mod, in whole or in part, to the Steam Workshop,
      Paradox Mods, or any other platform without written permission
      from the Project Northwind Team.
   b. Use the Mod's Original Content (including lore, focus trees,
      events, or graphical assets) in another project without written
      permission.
   c. Sell the Mod or any part of it, or place it behind a paywall.
   d. Remove or alter credits, this license, copyright notices, or any
      attribution given to third-party authors.


3. CONTRIBUTIONS

   By submitting a contribution (for example a pull request, patch, asset,
   or written material) to this repository, you:

   a. confirm that the contribution is your own original work, or that you
      have the right to submit it;
   b. keep the copyright to your contribution;
   c. grant the Project Northwind Team a perpetual, worldwide,
      royalty-free, non-exclusive license to use, modify, and distribute
      your contribution as part of the Mod, including under any future
      version of this license;
   d. will be credited as a contributor in the Mod's credits.

   If a contribution includes material from another mod or creator, the
   contributor must identify it and confirm that permission has been
   obtained.


